"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h2>Giza</h2><p>Giza linamaanisha kutokuwepo kwa mwanga. Hakukuwa na mwanga hadi Mungu alipouamuru uonekane. Kisha akatenganisha mwanga na giza (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01001002\" data-end-ref=\"01001002\">Mwanzo 1:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01001004\" data-end-ref=\"01001005\">4–5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01001018\" data-end-ref=\"01001018\">18</data>). Pigo la tisa alilotuma dhidi ya Misri lilikuwa siku tatu za giza kuu, bila mwanga kabisa (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02010021\" data-end-ref=\"02010023\">Kutoka 10:21–23</data>).</p><p>Giza linamzunguka Mungu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02020021\" data-end-ref=\"02020021\">Kutoka 20:21</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05004011\" data-end-ref=\"05004011\">Kumbukumbu la Torati 4:11</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05005023\" data-end-ref=\"05005023\">5:23</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10022012\" data-end-ref=\"10022012\">2 Samweli 22:12</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19018011\" data-end-ref=\"19018011\">Zaburi 18:11</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19097002\" data-end-ref=\"19097002\">97:2</data>). Anaishi katika giza kuu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"11008012\" data-end-ref=\"11008012\">1 Wafalme 8:12</data><em> </em>na kifungu sambamba katika<em> </em><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14006001\" data-end-ref=\"14006001\">2 Mambo ya Nyakati 6:1</data>). Giza kuu liko chini ya miguu yake (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10022010\" data-end-ref=\"10022010\">2 Samweli 22:10</data><em> </em>na kifungu sambamba katika <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19018009\" data-end-ref=\"19018009\">Zaburi 18:9</data>). Hatuwezi kumjua Mungu isipokuwa ajifunue mwenyewe.</p><p>Giza mara nyingi linaashiria dhiki na wasiwasi. Pia linaweza kumaanisha kuchanganyikiwa na uharibifu unaosababishwa na watu waovu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01015012\" data-end-ref=\"01015012\">Mwanzo 15:12</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18012025\" data-end-ref=\"18012025\">Ayubu 12:25</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18019008\" data-end-ref=\"18019008\">19:8</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19035006\" data-end-ref=\"19035006\">Zaburi 35:6</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19107010\" data-end-ref=\"19107010\">107:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19107014\" data-end-ref=\"19107014\">14</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"21005017\" data-end-ref=\"21005017\">Mhubiri 5:17</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23005030\" data-end-ref=\"23005030\">Isaiah 5:30</data>).</p><p>Kwa Ayubu, giza lilimaanisha utupu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18003004\" data-end-ref=\"18003006\">Ayubu 3:4–6</data>). Iliashilia kifo, nchi ya kivuli na huzuni ambapo wafu wanaishi, mbali na mwanga wa mchana (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18010021\" data-end-ref=\"18010022\">Ayubu 10:21–22</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18017012\" data-end-ref=\"18017013\">17:12–13</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"21006004\" data-end-ref=\"21006004\">Mhubiri 6:4</data>).</p><p>Uovu mara nyingi hutokea gizani (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18024016\" data-end-ref=\"18024017\">Ayubu 24:16–17</data>). Hata hivyo, giza haliwezi kuficha chochote kutoka kwa Mungu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19139011\" data-end-ref=\"19139012\">Zaburi 139:11–12</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23029015\" data-end-ref=\"23029016\">Isaya 29:15–16</data>). Giza mara nyingi linawakilisha kutojua mapenzi ya Mungu. Kumjua Mungu ni &quot;nuru,&quot; hivyo kutojua ni &quot;giza&quot; (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18012024\" data-end-ref=\"18012025\">Ayubu 12:24–25</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40004016\" data-end-ref=\"40004016\">Mathayo 4:16</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43001005\" data-end-ref=\"43001005\">Yohana 1:5</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43008012\" data-end-ref=\"43008012\">8:12</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43012035\" data-end-ref=\"43012035\">12:35</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43012046\" data-end-ref=\"43012046\">46</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"62001005\" data-end-ref=\"62001005\">1 Yohana 1:5</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"62002008\" data-end-ref=\"62002009\">2:8–9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"62002011\" data-end-ref=\"62002011\">11</data>).</p><p>Biblia mara nyingi hutumia &quot;giza&quot; kuelezea mtu au hali ya dhambi au uovu katika maisha (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20002013\" data-end-ref=\"20002013\">Mithali 2:13</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20004019\" data-end-ref=\"20004019\">4:19</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23005020\" data-end-ref=\"23005020\">Isaya 5:20</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23060002\" data-end-ref=\"23060002\">60:2</data>). Katika Agano Jipya, giza linaweza pia kuwakilisha kuishi bila ukweli wa Mungu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40006023\" data-end-ref=\"40006023\">Mathayo 6:23</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42011035\" data-end-ref=\"42011035\">Luka 11:35</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45002019\" data-end-ref=\"45002019\">Warumi 2:19</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"51001013\" data-end-ref=\"51001013\">Wakolosai 1:13</data>). <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23009002\" data-end-ref=\"23009002\">Isaya 9:2</data> inazungumzia watu wanaoishi katika dhiki ambao wanaona nuru kuu (tazama pia <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40004016\" data-end-ref=\"40004016\">Mathayo 4:16</data>;<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40004016\" data-end-ref=\"40004016\"> </data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42001079\" data-end-ref=\"42001079\">Luka 1:79</data>). Nuru hii ni Yesu mwenyewe. Katika muktadha huo, &quot;giza&quot; linarejelea zaidi mateso na uhitaji kuliko ujinga wa kiroho.</p><p>Mada kuu ya manabii wa Agano la Kale ilikuwa &quot;Siku ya BWANA,&quot; ambayo mara nyingi inahusishwa na giza (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26032008\" data-end-ref=\"26032008\">Ezekieli 32:8</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"29002002\" data-end-ref=\"29002002\">Yoeli 2:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"29002031\" data-end-ref=\"29002031\">31</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"30005018\" data-end-ref=\"30005018\">Amosi 5:18</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"30005020\" data-end-ref=\"30005020\">20</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"36001015\" data-end-ref=\"36001015\">Sefania 1:15</data>). Agano Jipya pia linaunganisha giza na hukumu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40008012\" data-end-ref=\"40008012\">Mathayo 8:12</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40022013\" data-end-ref=\"40022013\">22:13</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40025030\" data-end-ref=\"40025030\">25:30</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"61002017\" data-end-ref=\"61002017\">2 Petro 2:17</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"65001006\" data-end-ref=\"65001006\">Yuda 1:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"65001013\" data-end-ref=\"65001013\">13</data>).</p><h2>Nuru</h2><p>Nuru ilikuwa jambo la kwanza ambalo Mungu aliumba baada ya mbingu na dunia (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01001003\" data-end-ref=\"01001003\">Mwanzo 1:3</data>; tazama pia <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01001016\" data-end-ref=\"01001016\">1:16</data>). Kwa asili, inawakilisha kile kilicho cha kupendeza, chema, au chenye furaha (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"21011007\" data-end-ref=\"21011007\">Mhubiri 11:7</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"59001017\" data-end-ref=\"59001017\">Yakobo 1:17</data>). Wakati Waisraeli walipoondoka Misri, nguzo ya wingu na moto iliwapa mwanga (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02013021\" data-end-ref=\"02013021\">Kutoka 13:21</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02014020\" data-end-ref=\"02014020\">14:20</data>). Iliwaongoza njiani (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"16009019\" data-end-ref=\"16009019\">Nehemia 9:19</data>). Nuru inawakilisha baraka za Bwana (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18012022\" data-end-ref=\"18012022\">Ayubu 12:22</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18029002\" data-end-ref=\"18029003\">29:2–3</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19004006\" data-end-ref=\"19004006\">Zaburi 4:6</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19018028\" data-end-ref=\"19018028\">18:28</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19044003\" data-end-ref=\"19044003\">44:3</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19118027\" data-end-ref=\"19118027\">118:27</data>). Watumishi wa Mungu wanaweza kushiriki baraka hizi kwa kuwaongoza wengine kwa Mungu kupitia utiifu wao (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23042006\" data-end-ref=\"23042006\">Isaiah 42:6</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23049006\" data-end-ref=\"23049006\">49:6</data>). Nuru ya Mungu pia inafunua dhambi na kuleta haki (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19090008\" data-end-ref=\"19090008\">Zaburi 90:8</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23051004\" data-end-ref=\"23051004\">Isaiah 51:4</data>).</p><p>Biblia inamwelezea Mungu kama nuru (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19027001\" data-end-ref=\"19027001\">Zaburi 27:1</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23060019\" data-end-ref=\"23060020\">Isaya 60:19–20</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27002022\" data-end-ref=\"27002022\">Danieli 2:22</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"62001005\" data-end-ref=\"62001005\">1 Yohana 1:5</data>). Yeye &quot;anakaa katika nuru isiyoweza kufikiwa&quot; (tazama <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"54006016\" data-end-ref=\"54006016\">1 Timotheo 6:16</data>). Hata hivyo, huwaongoza wafuasi wake kwenye nuru (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"33007008\" data-end-ref=\"33007009\">Mika 7:8–9</data>; tazama pia <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"62001007\" data-end-ref=\"62001007\">1 Yohana 1:7</data>).</p><p>Yesu alisema, “Mimi ndiye nuru ya ulimwengu” (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43008012\" data-end-ref=\"43008012\">Yohana 8:12</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43009005\" data-end-ref=\"43009005\">9:5</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43012046\" data-end-ref=\"43012046\">12:46</data>). Alileta ujumbe kutoka kwa Mungu, na pia alikuwa ujumbe huo (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43001001\" data-end-ref=\"43001010\">Yohana 1:1–10</data>). Wale wanaopokea ujumbe wake na kumwamini, Anawapa &quot;haki ya kuwa watoto wa Mungu&quot; (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43001009\" data-end-ref=\"43001012\">Yohana 1:9–12</data>). Nuru yake inawaangazia kiroho na wanakuja kumjua Mungu na wokovu wake (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40004016\" data-end-ref=\"40004016\">Mathayo 4:16</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42002032\" data-end-ref=\"42002032\">Luka 2:32</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44013047\" data-end-ref=\"44013047\">Matendo 13:47</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44026018\" data-end-ref=\"44026018\">26:18</data>).</p><p>Wao ni &quot;wana wa nuru&quot; (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43012036\" data-end-ref=\"43012036\">Yohana 12:36</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"52005005\" data-end-ref=\"52005005\">1 Wathesalonike 5:5</data>). Wao &quot;wanatembea katika nuru&quot; (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"62001007\" data-end-ref=\"62001007\">1 Yohana 1:7</data>). Matendo yao ni kama nuru—kwa kufanya yaliyo mema, sahihi, na ya kweli (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"49005008\" data-end-ref=\"49005009\">Waefeso 5:8–9</data>).</p><p><u>Sehemu za Kusoma Zaidi</u></p><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01001003\" data-end-ref=\"01001005\">Mwanzo 1:3–5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01001014\" data-end-ref=\"01001018\">14–18</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01015012\" data-end-ref=\"01015012\">15:12</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02010021\" data-end-ref=\"02010023\">Kutoka 10:21–23</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02014020\" data-end-ref=\"02014020\">14:20</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02020021\" data-end-ref=\"02020021\">20:21</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10022010\" data-end-ref=\"10022013\">2 Samweli 22:10–13</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"11008012\" data-end-ref=\"11008012\">1 Wafalme 8:12</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18003003\" data-end-ref=\"18003007\">Ayubu 3:3–7</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18012022\" data-end-ref=\"18012025\">12:22–25</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18015022\" data-end-ref=\"18015022\">15:22</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18017012\" data-end-ref=\"18017013\">17:12–13</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18034022\" data-end-ref=\"18034022\">34:22</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19018011\" data-end-ref=\"19018011\">Zaburi 18:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19018028\" data-end-ref=\"19018028\">28</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19027001\" data-end-ref=\"19027001\">27:1</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19097002\" data-end-ref=\"19097006\">97:2–6</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19139011\" data-end-ref=\"19139012\">139:11–12</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20002013\" data-end-ref=\"20002013\">Mithali 2:13</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"20004018\" data-end-ref=\"20004019\">4:18–19</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"21011007\" data-end-ref=\"21011008\">Mhubiri 11:7–8</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23005020\" data-end-ref=\"23005020\">Isaiah 5:20</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23009002\" data-end-ref=\"23009002\">9:2</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23029015\" data-end-ref=\"23029015\">29:15</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23051004\" data-end-ref=\"23051004\">51:4</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23060002\" data-end-ref=\"23060003\">60:2–3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23060019\" data-end-ref=\"23060020\">19–20</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27002022\" data-end-ref=\"27002022\">Danieli 2:22</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"33007008\" data-end-ref=\"33007009\">Mika 7:8–9</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40004016\" data-end-ref=\"40004016\">Mathayo 4:16</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40006022\" data-end-ref=\"40006023\">6:22–23</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40008012\" data-end-ref=\"40008012\">8:12</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42001078\" data-end-ref=\"42001079\">Luka 1:78–79</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42002032\" data-end-ref=\"42002032\">2:32</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43001004\" data-end-ref=\"43001009\">Yohana 1:4–9</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43008012\" data-end-ref=\"43008012\">8:12</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43009005\" data-end-ref=\"43009005\">9:5</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43012035\" data-end-ref=\"43012036\">12:35–36</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43012046\" data-end-ref=\"43012046\">46</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44013047\" data-end-ref=\"44013047\">Matendo 13:47</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44026018\" data-end-ref=\"44026018\">26:18</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45002019\" data-end-ref=\"45002020\">Warumi 2:19–20</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"49005007\" data-end-ref=\"49005014\">Waefeso 5:7–14</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"52005005\" data-end-ref=\"52005008\">1 Wathesalonike 5:5–8</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"54006016\" data-end-ref=\"54006016\">1 Timotheo 6:16</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"59001017\" data-end-ref=\"59001017\">Yakobo 1:17</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"61002017\" data-end-ref=\"61002017\">2 Petro 2:17</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"62001005\" data-end-ref=\"62001007\">1 Yohana 1:5–7</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"62002007\" data-end-ref=\"62002011\">2:7–11</data></p>",
